<%% content_for :preheader, "Your account email address was changed." %>
<h1 style="margin:0 0 16px;font-size:26px;line-height:1.25;">Email address changed</h1>
<p style="margin:0 0 16px;color:#374151;line-height:1.7;">The email for your account changed from <strong><%%= @previous_email %></strong> to <strong><%%= @user.email %></strong>.</p>
<p style="margin:0;color:#4b5563;line-height:1.7;">All existing sessions were signed out. If you did not make this change, contact support immediately.</p>
